      "value": "@{5f6be62b15f9fa5364f1834c|full_name}: Hmm, that would explain why you're seeing the null on the first call to GetPlayerTag, but not why this would have started happening after the persistence update. I would have expected this behavior to predate that update by...quite a while. Were there any changes on your end that would have landed around the same time as persistence?",
